# REST Client — สร้าง Content ทดสอบ
# ใช้ใน Cursor/VS Code: ติดตั้ง extension "REST Client" แล้วกด "Send Request" เหนือแต่ละ ###
#
# แก้ @channel ให้ตรงกับ slug ใน /admin/channels
# แก้ JSON ในไฟล์ .json หรือใน ### Template ด้านล่าง แล้วกด Send

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@apiKey = dev-n8n-api-key-change-in-production
@creatorEmail = creator@idea.local

### สร้าง Content — video nook__th (IG + TikTok)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/content
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-user-email: {{creatorEmail}}

< ./video-nook-th.json

### สร้าง Content — image idea_content_post (IG)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/content
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-user-email: {{creatorEmail}}

< ./image-idea-content-post.json

### สร้าง Content — video nook_down (TikTok)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/content
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-user-email: {{creatorEmail}}

< ./video-nook-down.json

### Template — แก้ JSON ด้านล่างแล้วกด Send
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/content
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-user-email: {{creatorEmail}}

{
  "name": "ชื่อ Content ทดสอบ",
  "mediaType": "video",
  "channel": "nook__th",
  "platforms": ["instagram"],
  "details": "รายละเอียดงาน",
  "location": ["Studio A"],
  "scheduledDate": "2026-07-20",
  "scheduledTime": "10:00",
  "endTime": "12:00",
  "team": [],
  "productsNeeded": [],
  "itemsToPrepare": "",
  "filmingEquipment": [],
  "attachments": [],
  "script": [],
  "ideaCreator": "Creator Demo",
  "photographer": "",
  "editor": "",
  "category": "",
  "tags": [],
  "imageMeta": {
    "objective": "",
    "headline": "",
    "subHead": "",
    "callToAction": "",
    "requiredElements": [],
    "workSizes": []
  }
}

### ทดสอบ n8n webhook — NK0001 (หลังแก้ Compute Wait Until แล้ว)
POST http://localhost:5678/webhook/content-approved
Content-Type: application/json

< ./test-nk0001.json
